id: SECRETS-074
title: Confluent Cloud API Key
category: secrets
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .tsx .js .jsx .py .java .go .rb .rs .cpp .h .cs .php .env .yml .yaml .json .toml .xml .properties .cfg .ini .conf .sh .tf .hcl
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/ __pycache__/ .venv/ target/
  content_contains: confluent
patterns:
  - regex: [A-Z0-9]{16}
    message: Confluent Cloud API key detected. This grants access to Kafka clusters, topics, and stream processing.
fix: Delete the key at Confluent Cloud > API Keys. Create a new key with minimal ACLs and store it in environment variables.
